    - `DestinationIp`

- `TrafficScenario = CbwpMetric` (Internet Shared Bandwidth metric analysis scenario):
  - The `like` operator is supported when the key is one of the following:
    - `PublicIpAddress`

For all other fields, only the `in` and `not in` operators are supported.', example='in'),
      value?: [ string ](name='Value', description='The value of the filter condition.'),
    }
  ](name='Filter', description='Specifies additional filter conditions for focused network traffic analysis.'),
